cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this list or its measurement harness in your work, please cite it
  using the metadata below. To cite a specific snapshot, include the commit hash
  or release tag you accessed.
title: Awesome Token Minimalism
abstract: >-
  An evidence-graded, continuously updated catalogue of papers, tools, and
  patterns for spending fewer tokens on all three sides of an LLM call — input,
  output, and lifetime — in service of lower cost, latency, energy, and higher
  accuracy. Every entry carries an evidence grade: [measured], [self-reported],
  [asserted], or [negative]. The repository also ships a paired A/B measurement
  harness and a token ledger comparing advertised savings against independently
  measured ones.
type: dataset
